OL,3,GNEWSAWhat has happened in Plaid Cymru's
OL,4,Afirst 100 days in power?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlaid Cymru claimed victory in
OL,7,Fcelebratory scenes on the steps of the
OL,8,FSenedd in May, after it inflicted a
OL,9,Fheavy and historic defeat on Welsh
OL,10,FLabour.
OL,12,FSince then, it has been an occasionally
OL,13,Frough ride for Rhun ap Iorwerth's
OL,14,Fminority administration.
OL,16,FAfter 100 days in charge, Plaid
OL,17,Fministers say they have laid the
OL,18,Ffoundations to improve public services,
OL,19,Fand have already made a "tangible"
OL,20,Fimpact in areas like childcare.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
