OL,3,GNEWSAWhat has happened in Plaid Cymru's
OL,4,Afirst 100 days in power?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the government failed to get over
OL,7,Fits first significant hurdle in the
OL,8,FSenedd, when its supplementary budget
OL,9,Fwas rejected by the entire Senedd
OL,10,Fopposition.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
